                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9f40b040-95fc-3264-9add-5e287a8b57f4",
                        "entry_id": "a36f8e83-32f9-331d-a9cc-eecf5d4f82f3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "männlicher Vorname, in etwa „starker Herrscher“"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e963b610-b5f0-42ee-8832-f83a791a7a0b",
                                "sense_id": "9f40b040-95fc-3264-9add-5e287a8b57f4",
                                "text": "„König Richard III. starb als letzter englischer Monarch auf dem Schlachtfeld – in der Schlacht von Bosworth, in der sein Heer auf das des späteren englischen Herrschers Heinrich VII. traf.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5c52bc7-4b8c-4a26-933a-168204416ac2",
                        "source_entry_id": "a36f8e83-32f9-331d-a9cc-eecf5d4f82f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "9f40b040-95fc-3264-9add-5e287a8b57f4",
                        "source_sense_description": "männlicher Vorname, in etwa „starker Herrscher“",
                        "target_lang_word": "Richard",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Richard",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf3ff0cb-432e-3d24-b020-6a778376d2fb",
                                        "entry_id": "37258d5f-bf37-3acf-a29f-5ef4c1182495",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from the Germanic languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82d4f46b-3624-4223-a340-52d04ef8102b",
                                                "sense_id": "cf3ff0cb-432e-3d24-b020-6a778376d2fb",
                                                "text": "What! do I fear myself? there's no one else by; / Richard loves Richard; that is, I am I."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ed62c4d-bc97-4991-b2c1-2a263b844ee4",
                                                "sense_id": "cf3ff0cb-432e-3d24-b020-6a778376d2fb",
                                                "text": "But we have known Williams and Richards, names not found in sacred story, but familiar to our country, prove as gracious saints as any Safe deliverance, Fight the good fight of faith, or such like,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28355a56-c0f0-4ef8-b1a7-dd555c7464d6",
                                                "sense_id": "cf3ff0cb-432e-3d24-b020-6a778376d2fb",
                                                "text": "I'd love to live in our castle. First I'd change my name from Dickie to Richard. That's my real name and it's a good king name. I don't like being called Dickie anyway, and I don't want to be Dick Junior either because everybody starts calling you Junior. What I'd like to be called is Rich but I don't know how to start people doing it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19a65ef3-3dd6-4a67-839c-7397ca48a829",
                                                "sense_id": "cf3ff0cb-432e-3d24-b020-6a778376d2fb",
                                                "text": "While the less-than-a-word improvement was statistically significant, it would be hard to tell if such a small change would improve a person’s life, said Alzheimer’s disease researcher Dr. Richard Isaacson, a preventive neurologist at the Institute for Neurodegenerative Diseases of Florida."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5767c069-41bd-31b8-8ae0-64983ca2ba5d",
                                        "entry_id": "37258d5f-bf37-3acf-a29f-5ef4c1182495",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname originating as a patronymic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b4b9083-e402-45f8-8fca-2b6d31ae2f8b",
                                                "sense_id": "5767c069-41bd-31b8-8ae0-64983ca2ba5d",
                                                "text": "Martin Richard was the youngest of three people killed by explosions at the Boston Marathon in 2013."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b481c52-9417-4a7c-b826-5796dc576727",
                        "source_entry_id": "a36f8e83-32f9-331d-a9cc-eecf5d4f82f3",
                        "source_sense_id": "9f40b040-95fc-3264-9add-5e287a8b57f4",
                        "source_sense_description": "männlicher Vorname, in etwa „starker Herrscher“",
                        "target_lang_word": "Richard",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Richard",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e329aa1d-c84d-37eb-89c1-3a918d1b9d60",
                                        "entry_id": "05766768-7c83-3b02-a90e-b6dbb0db82ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom masculin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f47f4204-39e4-4e53-b60b-e0ee8ebc72df",
                                                "sense_id": "e329aa1d-c84d-37eb-89c1-3a918d1b9d60",
                                                "text": "Richard avait oublié de nous parler d’une vodka-pomme qu’il aurait consommée lors de la soirée au Set à Miami."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0fe837c7-08ba-41dd-8a11-028678a73af5",
                                                "sense_id": "e329aa1d-c84d-37eb-89c1-3a918d1b9d60",
                                                "text": "Au premier tour de l’US Open, mardi, Richard Gasquet a disposé du Japonais Taro Daniel (6-4, 6-7, 6-2, 6-2), tandis que Benoît Paire a été balayé par l’Anglais Cameron Norrie (6-0, 7-6, 6-0)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98d9deb4-d615-4541-ae16-85a5da7df80d",
                                                "sense_id": "e329aa1d-c84d-37eb-89c1-3a918d1b9d60",
                                                "text": "Et c’est comme ça que Fesneau s’est retrouvé aux côtés de Bayrou pour négocier face à Richard Ferrand les circonscriptions concédées au MoDem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Richard",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dfc1a4c2-557b-3864-b298-b8ae8a75166c",
                                        "entry_id": "345f4b6f-7d9f-3c19-89f2-e70365c07012",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cafadf6-f574-402c-a4fb-c4d23fa92652",
                                                "sense_id": "dfc1a4c2-557b-3864-b298-b8ae8a75166c",
                                                "text": "Signe que le nouveau centre d’excellence attire, plusieurs navigateurs se sont entraînés sous la houlette du Vendéen Étienne Saïz, l’ancien coach de Xavier Macaire. L’Allemand Jörg Riechers, la Vendéenne Charlotte Yven, l’Irlandais Kenneth Rumball, et des Rochelais : Alexis Thomas (26 ans, « Ma chance moi aussi », Robin Marais (35 ans, « Charente-Maritime ») et un petit nouveau, Romen Richard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "697a4e7c-0579-49dc-b734-fff8ce6bfe39",
                                                "sense_id": "dfc1a4c2-557b-3864-b298-b8ae8a75166c",
                                                "text": "Un industriel, joué par Michel Bouquet, offrait Pierre Richard à son gamin pourri gâté qui voulait en faire son joujou vivant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a564710-0de7-45d2-bdeb-372c26f8f52a",
                                                "sense_id": "dfc1a4c2-557b-3864-b298-b8ae8a75166c",
                                                "text": "Quant au bureau du club, il se renouvelle en raison des arrêts de Kévin Richard, vice-président, et Christelle Monteil, trésorière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ba92b406-d658-446e-a719-9ad66821e672",
                        "source_entry_id": "a36f8e83-32f9-331d-a9cc-eecf5d4f82f3",
